1. Structured Prompt

Design a Flight Search System.

Business Requirement:
Users should be able to search for flights by providing travel details and view matching flight options.
Inputs:
From City
To City
Departure Date
Number of Passengers
Travel Class
System Functions
Search available flights
Display search results
Allow flight selection

Output Required
Provide:
Functional Requirements
Validation Rules
Assumptions
Error Messages
Acceptance Criteria

